  "question": {
    "text": "If the tangent at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> to the curve <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math> touch&nbsp;the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math> is:"
